    <http://example.org/node/chunk196> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects the solution to provide a high level of answer relevance, support medical coding (PMSI, ICD-10) for activity reporting, and take into account dossier context where available." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk197> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we design the AI components to meet these requirements, and what innovation strategies can we propose to improve the quality and safety of care delivered to patients?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk198> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address The client expectations, we AI solution can leverage our AI solution Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities, which allow for hybrid retrieval, re-ranking, query reformulation, multi-document synthesis, and structured extraction. we can design the AI components to meet these requirements by focusing on the following aspects:  Firstly, to provide a high level of answer relevance, we will employ we RAG approach to generate answers grounded in the organization's own validated documents, including care protocols, HAS recommendations, internal procedures, applicable regulatory texts, and internal guides. employ ensures that the information provided is not only relevant but also contextually appropriate for the healthcare environment." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk199> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Secondly, to support medical coding for activity reporting (PMSI, ICD-10), our AI solution can utilize our AI solution structured extraction capabilities. utilize enables the assistant to help with tasks like assisting PMSI/ICD-10 coding from clinical notes, thereby streamlining the process and reducing potential errors in coding." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk2> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Context and objectives The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) is a public regional hospital serving the Belval region (approximately 1,200 beds and 4,500 staff across medical, care and medico-administrative functions)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk20> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The titleholder must guarantee strict compliance with the GDPR." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk200> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, taking into account dossier context where available is crucial for providing contextualized support. our AI solution can achieve taking through our AI solution capability for dossier-context continuity, allowing our AI solution to generate structured handover summaries that enable professionals to efficiently take over an in-progress dossier with full context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk201> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This feature ensures that the assistance provided is always relevant to the specific case or patient being handled." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk202> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of innovation strategies to improve the quality and safety of care delivered to patients, we propose several approaches: 1. **Iterative Engagement**: we suggest adopting an iterative approach with the client, starting with corpus selection and curation, retrieval tuning, prompt and template design per use case, followed by an evaluation loop. an iterative approach ensures that the solution is continuously refined based on feedback and performance metrics. 2. **Integration with Existing Workflows**: our AI solution is designed to fit into existing clinical and administrative workflows without introducing disruption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk203> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By integrating seamlessly with current practices and tools (such as DPI and web portals), we can enhance efficiency and reduce the learning curve for staff, thereby improving overall quality of care. 3. **Continuous Training and Support**: we recommend providing training for professionals on how to use the AI assistance tool effectively. training for professionals on how to use the AI assistance tool effectively not only includes initial training but also ongoing support to ensure that users are comfortable with our AI solution and can maximize our AI solution benefits in users daily activities. 4. **Data Sovereignty and Security**: Emphasizing data sovereignty, our AI solution ensures that all data is hosted exclusively within the European Union and is subject to strict data protection regulations (such as GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk204> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This provides an additional layer of security and compliance, critical for sensitive healthcare information. 5. **Innovation through Technology**: By leveraging AI technologies like RAG and continually updating our methodologies based on advancements in the field, our can offer innovative solutions that not only meet current needs but also anticipate future requirements in healthcare, thereby contributing to improved quality and safety of care." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk205> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By focusing on these strategies and leveraging our AI capabilities, our aim to provide a comprehensive solution that meets the client's expectations while enhancing the overall quality and safety of patient care." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk206> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires the solution to contribute to reducing energy consumption, rely on low-carbon infrastructure, and limit the environmental footprint of the authority's information systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk207> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What sustainability trade-offs should we consider, and how can we demonstrate we capacity for innovation in this area?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk208> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a CSR & Sustainability officer at Faber IA, I can highlight that Faber IA has already taken steps to reduce Faber IA environmental impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk209> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA have a published trajectory to reduce carbon intensity per managed assistant year on year, and Faber IA report the deployment footprint to clients." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk21> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Health data is processed as special-category data (GDPR Art. 9) and medical confidentiality (secret médical) must be preserved." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk210> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "One known CSR tension is the trade-off between high availability and energy consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk211> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA present the more energy-intensive premium high-availability configuration with the more energy-intensive premium high-availability configuration with its associated footprint associated footprint so that the trade-off between high availability and energy consumption is explicit." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk212> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To demonstrate Faber IA capacity for innovation in sustainability, I can point out that Faber IA have a green hosting partner, OuraneCloud, which uses renewable energy, has a power usage effectiveness (PUE) of 1.2, and reuses heat." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk213> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA also practice digital sobriety through model right-sizing, caching, and batching." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk214> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without more specific information on the client's requirements and Faber IA current infrastructure, I cannot provide a detailed plan for reducing energy consumption or relying on low-carbon infrastructure in this particular project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk215> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering, in consortium with OuraneCloud, Ligeo Sant, and the French Public AI Research Laboratory, proposes an innovative AI assistance solution for hospital staff. an innovative AI assistance solution for hospital staff aims to enhance patient care quality by providing intelligent assistance tools for clinical and administrative activities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message18> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk216> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering approach ensures continuity of care between professionals, shifts, and services, while minimizing total costs and considering environmental issues. an innovative AI assistance solution for hospital staff integrates with existing Hospital Information Systems (SIH) and Electronic Patient Records (DPI), ensuring seamless access to reliable and up-to-date information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message18> .

